
  <main id="main">

    <!-- ============ HERO ============ -->
    <section class="page-head industry-head">
      <div class="container">
        <span class="eyebrow">AI for business · South Africa</span>
        <h1>Put AI to work in your business.</h1>
        <p class="lead">Not AI for the sake of it. I find the thing that wastes your time or loses you customers, and I build AI into a tool you already use to fix it. Answer customers at midnight, stop retyping the same quotes, get instant answers out of your own paperwork.</p>
        <div class="btn-row" style="margin-top:1.4rem">
          <a href="start?type=AI" class="btn btn--primary btn--large">Start an AI project</a>
          <a href="demos#ai-assistant" class="btn btn--ghost btn--large">See how it feels</a>
        </div>
        <p class="hero__freebie"><span class="hero__freebie-tag">Free</span> Not sure where AI fits? Tell me your biggest time-waster and I’ll tell you honestly whether AI helps, and how. No charge, no obligation.</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ============ QUALIFIER ============ -->
    <section class="section section--tint" id="ai-qualifier" aria-labelledby="qzTitle">
      <div class="container container--narrow">
        <div class="section__head section__head--center reveal">
          <span class="eyebrow">Free · 30 seconds</span>
          <h2 id="qzTitle">Where would AI help you most?</h2>
          <p>Pick the one that sounds most like your business. I’ll tell you what I’d build and roughly what it costs — no jargon, no obligation.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="qz reveal" data-qz>
          <div class="qz__options" id="qzOptions">
            <button type="button" class="qz__opt" data-product="wa" data-pain="Customers message after hours and I miss them">Customers message after hours and I miss them</button>
            <button type="button" class="qz__opt" data-product="wa" data-pain="I answer the same questions all day long">I answer the same questions all day long</button>
            <button type="button" class="qz__opt" data-product="know" data-pain="I dig through documents or manuals to find answers">I dig through documents or manuals to find answers</button>
            <button type="button" class="qz__opt" data-product="admin" data-pain="I retype the same quotes, emails or documents">I retype the same quotes, emails or documents</button>
            <button type="button" class="qz__opt" data-product="content" data-pain="I never get around to posting or marketing">I never get around to posting or marketing</button>
          </div>
          <div class="qz__result" id="qzResult" hidden>
            <div class="qz__rec">
              <span class="eyebrow">What I’d build you</span>
              <h3 id="qzName"></h3>
              <p id="qzLine"></p>
              <p class="qz__price">From <b>R5,900</b> to build, then <b>R550/month</b> to look after it. The AI usage is billed separately, at cost.</p>
            </div>
            <form class="form qz__form" id="qzForm" novalidate>
              <p class="small muted">Send me a free, no-obligation plan for this:</p>
              <div class="form-row"><label for="qzN">Your name</label><input id="qzN" name="name" autocomplete="name" /></div>
              <div class="form-row"><label for="qzB">Business name</label><input id="qzB" name="business" /></div>
              <div class="form-row"><label for="qzP">WhatsApp number</label><input id="qzP" name="phone" inputmode="tel" placeholder="082 000 0000" /></div>
              <details><summary>Prefer email?</summary><div class="form-row" style="margin-top:0.6rem"><label for="qzE">Email</label><input id="qzE" name="email" type="email" inputmode="email" /></div></details>
              <input type="text" name="_gotcha" tabindex="-1" autocomplete="off" aria-hidden="true" style="position:absolute;left:-9999px;width:1px;height:1px;opacity:0" />
              <p class="callsched__error" id="qzError" role="alert" hidden></p>
              <button type="submit" class="btn btn--primary btn--full" id="qzSubmit">Get my free AI plan</button>
              <button type="button" class="inline-link qz__back" data-qz-back>← Pick a different goal</button>
            </form>
            <div class="qz__done" id="qzDone" hidden>
              <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"/></svg>
              <h3>Thanks!</h3>
              <p id="qzDoneMsg"></p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ============ FOUR OUTCOMES ============ -->
    <section class="section" aria-labelledby="waysTitle">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="section__head reveal">
          <span class="eyebrow">What it actually does</span>
          <h2 id="waysTitle">Four ways AI earns its place.</h2>
          <p>Each one is built around your real business: your hours, your prices, your documents, your voice. The AI works from your facts, not guesses.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="grid grid--2">
          <div class="card reveal">
            <span class="card__icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M4 20l1.3-3.8A8 8 0 1 1 8 19.2Z"/><path d="M9 11h.01M12.5 11h.01M16 11h.01"/></svg></span>
            <h3>Answer customers 24/7</h3>
            <p>A WhatsApp or website assistant that answers the questions you get asked all day — hours, prices, bookings, "do you do X?" — day and night, instantly. It hands the real leads over to you instead of letting them go cold overnight.</p>
            <p class="small muted"><b>Good for:</b> salons, trades, restaurants, guesthouses — anyone losing after-hours enquiries.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="card reveal">
            <span class="card__icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M4 4h12l4 4v12H4z"/><path d="M8 11h8M8 15h5"/></svg></span>
            <h3>Instant answers from your documents</h3>
            <p>Point AI at your manuals, policies, product lists or price sheets, and your staff (or customers) get a straight answer in seconds instead of digging through files or asking you. Like having someone who's read everything and never forgets.</p>
            <p class="small muted"><b>Good for:</b> businesses with lots of products, procedures or paperwork.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="card reveal">
            <span class="card__icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M4 4v5h5"/><path d="M20 20v-5h-5"/><path d="M4.5 9A8 8 0 0 1 19 7"/><path d="M19.5 15A8 8 0 0 1 5 17"/></svg></span>
            <h3>Stop retyping the same things</h3>
            <p>AI that drafts your quotes, replies, summaries and reports from the details you already have — so a quote that took twenty minutes takes two, and you just check and send.</p>
            <p class="small muted"><b>Good for:</b> anyone sending similar quotes, emails or documents over and over.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="card reveal">
            <span class="card__icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M12 3l1.8 5.2L19 10l-5.2 1.8L12 17l-1.8-5.2L5 10l5.2-1.8z"/><path d="M19 17l.8 2.2L22 20l-2.2.8L19 23l-.8-2.2L16 20l2.2-.8z"/></svg></span>
            <h3>Content in your voice</h3>
            <p>Social posts, product descriptions and email campaigns written in your tone, from a few words of direction — so marketing stops being the job you never get to.</p>
            <p class="small muted"><b>Good for:</b> businesses that know they should post more but never find the time.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ============ HOW IT WORKS ============ -->
    <section class="section section--tint" aria-labelledby="howTitle">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="section__head reveal">
          <span class="eyebrow">How it works</span>
          <h2 id="howTitle">Honest, hands-off, and built around you.</h2>
          <p>All of it happens online, anywhere in South Africa. You never touch the technical side.</p>
        </div>
        <ol class="steps reveal">
          <li class="step"><span class="step__num">1</span><h3>I find where it helps</h3><p>A free chat about where your time goes and where customers slip away. If AI won't genuinely help, I’ll say so.</p></li>
          <li class="step"><span class="step__num">2</span><h3>Fixed quote first</h3><p>You get a fixed price for the build and a clear, honest estimate of the running cost. Nothing starts until you accept.</p></li>
          <li class="step"><span class="step__num">3</span><h3>I build and connect it</h3><p>I set it up inside a tool you already use — WhatsApp, your website, your inbox — and test it on your real business.</p></li>
          <li class="step"><span class="step__num">4</span><h3>I look after it</h3><p>On a maintenance plan I keep it accurate, secure and up to date, and keep an eye on the running cost so there are no surprises.</p></li>
        </ol>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ============ PRICING ============ -->
    <section class="section" id="pricing" aria-labelledby="priceTitle">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="section__head reveal">
          <span class="eyebrow">What it costs</span>
          <h2 id="priceTitle">Three clear parts. Nothing hidden.</h2>
          <p>The same honest approach as my websites: a fixed price to build, a plan to look after it, and the AI's own running cost passed straight through to you.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="grid grid--3 reveal">
          <div class="card">
            <h3>1. Build it</h3>
            <span class="price"><small>once-off, from</small>R5,900</span>
            <p class="small muted" style="margin-top:0.6rem">Finding where AI helps, setting it up on your business, connecting it to your tools and testing it. Fixed price in your quote before you pay anything.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="card card--tint">
            <h3>2. Look after it</h3>
            <span class="price"><small>from</small>R550<span class="per">/mo</span></span>
            <p class="small muted" style="margin-top:0.6rem">Maintenance &amp; security: keeping it accurate as your business changes, keeping it safe, updating it, and watching the running cost. Monthly, or pay yearly and save (2 months free).</p>
          </div>
          <div class="card">
            <h3>3. The AI usage</h3>
            <span class="price">At cost</span>
            <p class="small muted" style="margin-top:0.6rem">What the AI provider charges to run — passed straight to you, never marked up or bundled in, so you always know exactly what you're paying and can see it going up or down.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <p class="center small muted section__foot reveal">Most small businesses start with one focused tool, then add more once it's paying for itself. Prices are starting points; your fixed quote comes first.</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ============ TRY THE REAL ASSISTANT ============ -->
    <section class="section section--tint" id="try" aria-labelledby="tryTitle">
      <div class="container container--narrow">
        <div class="section__head section__head--center reveal">
          <span class="eyebrow">Try it</span>
          <h2 id="tryTitle">Don't take my word for it. Ask mine.</h2>
          <p>This assistant is the real thing, running on my own site and answering from my own prices and process — exactly what I’d build for your business.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="reveal">
          <div class="asst" data-assistant>
            <div class="asst__log" aria-live="polite" aria-label="Conversation">
              <div class="asst__msg asst__msg--ai">Hi! I'm Re-Charge's own AI assistant — the same kind I build for clients. Ask me anything about what Re-Charge does, what it costs or how it works.</div>
            </div>
            <div class="asst__chips">
              <button type="button">What does AI cost for a small business?</button>
              <button type="button">How much is a website?</button>
              <button type="button">What can an AI assistant actually do for me?</button>
              <button type="button">How quickly can you build it?</button>
            </div>
            <form class="asst__form">
              <label class="sr-only" for="asstIn1">Ask a question</label>
              <input class="asst__input" id="asstIn1" type="text" maxlength="500" placeholder="Ask about AI, websites or prices…" autocomplete="off" />
              <button type="submit" class="btn btn--primary asst__send">Ask</button>
            </form>
            <p class="asst__note">This is real AI, answering from Re-Charge's own information — not a script. It can be wrong; for anything important, check with me on WhatsApp.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ============ FAQ ============ -->
    <section class="section" aria-labelledby="faqTitle">
      <div class="container container--narrow">
        <div class="section__head reveal"><span class="eyebrow">Questions</span><h2 id="faqTitle">Straight answers.</h2></div>
        <div class="faq reveal">
          <details class="faq__item"><summary>Do I need to be technical to use AI in my business?</summary><p>No. I find where AI actually saves you time or wins you customers, build it into a tool you already use (like WhatsApp), and set it up for you. You just use it.</p></details>
          <details class="faq__item"><summary>What does AI cost for a small business?</summary><p>Building it starts from R5,900, with a fixed quote before you pay. Looking after it (maintenance and security) is from R550 a month, or pay yearly and save. The AI usage itself is billed separately at cost, so you always know what you're paying and it's never hidden in the price.</p></details>
          <details class="faq__item"><summary>Is my business data safe?</summary><p>Yes. I only use your information to power your own tool, I don't share it, and I set things up so the AI answers from your real business facts rather than making things up. Keeping it secure is part of the maintenance plan.</p></details>
          <details class="faq__item"><summary>Can the AI answer customers on WhatsApp?</summary><p>Yes. A WhatsApp or website assistant trained on your hours, prices, services and FAQs can answer customers day and night, and hand over to you when it's a real lead.</p></details>
          <details class="faq__item"><summary>What if AI isn't right for my business?</summary><p>Then I’ll tell you. The first chat is free and honest: if a simple website, a Google profile or an automation would help you more than AI, I’ll point you there instead.</p></details>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ============ CTA ============ -->
    <section class="cta" aria-labelledby="ctaTitle">
      <div class="container cta__inner reveal">
        <span class="cta__services">AI assistants · Automation · Knowledge tools</span>
        <h2 id="ctaTitle">Tell me your biggest time-waster.</h2>
        <p>I’ll tell you honestly whether AI helps, and what it would cost. The first conversation is free.</p>
        <div class="btn-row btn-row--center">
          <a href="start?type=AI" class="btn btn--light btn--large">Start an AI project</a>
          <a href="services" class="btn btn--ghost-light btn--large">See everything I build</a>
        </div>
        <p class="small muted" data-contact-block hidden>Prefer to talk first? <a class="inline-link" href="#" data-contact="whatsapp" hidden>WhatsApp me</a></p>
      </div>
    </section>

  </main>
